            <title>[IGNITE-11766] cpp: JVM library not found for openjdk 11 on windows</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11766</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Trying to run compiled ignite.exe from platforms/cpp on windows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
An error occurred: JVM library is not found (did you set JAVA_HOME environment variable?)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Think problem that&#160;platforms\cpp\jni\os\win\src\utils -&amp;gt; JAVA_DDL = &quot;\\jre\\bin\\server&lt;br class=&quot;atl-forced-newline&quot; /&gt;jvm.dll&quot;&#160;&lt;br/&gt;
searching for jre in jdk directory&lt;/p&gt;</description>
